<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Mifuyu Niimura is suspicious after all, you say.<PG>
She could also have made paper dolls and shown them to Haruka Niimura.<PG>
And if she bore a grudge against the Kogori family over Eiichiro Niimura's accidental death, the motive is sufficient too.<PG>
If so, why did she take action now, after all of 12 years? Even if she is the culprit, there are many mysteries to be unraveled as well.<PG>
I think it would not be bad to follow the scenarios from the viewpoint that she is the culprit.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
